{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"2.2.0","notes":"Nexus 2.2.0: a new online voice for the orb\n\n- The orb now talks with Microsoft's free online neural voices. No limit, no account, nothing to download, and it doesn't use your PC's power.\n- New default voice: Ryan, a calm British assistant voice. Pick from 16 English voices and a tone (Normal, Deeper, Quicker) in Settings > Assistant > Online voice.\n- If the online voice can't be reached (no internet), the orb uses the offline PC voice, then the Windows voice, so it never goes silent.\n- The offline PC voice (Kokoro) now only downloads when you choose it.","payload":"","signature":"fAZWrMwJbp71lSz2L/ktbiWvaU4IaC6sVNwL/HObf+MVNU2LvnTl+gQWRN0QukGd/o5r2YWexUkAGxGPnHuODQ=="}